# Extracted BU production data for the Huron discovery package.
# These files hold real KCOEUS production rows (PII redacted, but still
# institutional data) and must not be committed. The scripts that regenerate
# them, and the metadata/documentation, ARE tracked.
reference/package/**/*.csv
!reference/package/01_data_dictionary.csv
!reference/package/02_table_manifest.csv
!reference/package/02_excluded_tables.csv
!reference/package/02_extract_log.csv

